      "writtenOn": "2020-11-24T20:40:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are two FIFO queues. One on TCPC, one in EC. When EC FIFO is full, it tight-loops here. The #ALERT line from TCPC is left asserted causing watchdog.\n\nThis NOOP read \"discards\" the message from the TCPC FIFO when there is no more room in EC FIFO. This clears the #ALERT, rather than tight-looping.",
      "parentUuid": "1bc8b620_88006e99",
